"(f) x x x; and "(g) X X X."
TITLE V. – CORPORATE STRUCTURE

Section 16 of Republic Act No. 7306 is hereby amended to read as follows:
"SEC. 16. General Program Standards. – The Board of Directors is mandated to set up a Code of Standards, inclusive of the following aspects:
"(a) Presentations of news;
"(b) Public Affairs Programs and Commentaries;
"(c) Public Service Programs;
"(d) Educational Programs;
"(e) Children’s Programs;
"(f) Agriculture and Livelihood Programs;
"(g) Women and Youth Issues;
"(h) Locally-produced and foreign produced programs;
"(i) Trade, service and manufacturing industry programs; and "(j) Programs that inspire nationalism."
